<title>NETHERLANDS: Suez Nederland raises Atag to a Buy.</title>
<headline>Suez Nederland raises Atag to a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of October research.</p>
<p>Company-------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>    Atag    Consumer products  115.50  Suez Nederland Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (from Hold).</p>
<p>Profits expected to increase in coming years as consumer spending seen picking up and previously acquired companies offer opportunities for synergy and improving results. Introduction of new products will lead to turn-around in central heating activities. We have confidence that profits will rise. Therefore, and because of the sharp decline in the stock price, we have upgraded the stock to a Buy.  </p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	   P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	10.58	 10.0    4.10</p>
<p>    1996		   10.35	 11.2    4.10</p>
<p>    1997		   12.55	  9.2    4.25</p>
<p>    1998		   13.92	  8.3    4.75</p>
